      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">13. Administration Rights, Suspension &amp; Termination</h2>
        <p>
          To protect the community and enforce these Terms, Pasabaya may restrict, suspend, or terminate an account, listing, or membership where reasonably necessary, including when:
        </p>
