        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the <strong>Republic of the Philippines</strong>. Disputes may be brought before the Philippine courts or authorities with jurisdiction under applicable law. Nothing in these Terms prevents you from raising a data privacy complaint with the National Privacy Commission or using another remedy available by law.
